---
// src/pages/index.astro
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="es" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Grupo Hirbell - Ingeniería y Servicios Generales</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 antialiased">
    <!-- NAVEGACIÓN -->
    <header class="fixed w-full bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm z-50">
      <div
        class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 tracking-tight"
            >GRUPO <span class="text-red-600">HIRBELL</span></span
          >
        </div>
        <nav
          class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 font-medium text-sm text-slate-600"
        >
          <a href="#inicio" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors"
            >Inicio</a
          >
          <a href="#nosotros" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors"
            >Nosotros</a
          >
          <a href="#servicios" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors"
            >Servicios</a
          >
          <a
            href="#contacto"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors shadow-sm"
            >Contáctanos</a
          >
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section
      id="inicio"
      class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-48 lg:pb-32 overflow-hidden"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888086225-eb106367781b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2070&q=80"
          alt="Ingeniería"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-10"
        />
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/60 to-slate-50"
        >
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <h1
          class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6"
        >
          Calidad, Precisión e <br /><span class="text-blue-600"
            >Ingeniería.</span
          >
        </h1>
        <p
          class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed"
        >
          Somos una empresa orientada a satisfacer y colaborar con el desarrollo
          y fortalecimiento de nuestros clientes, empleando la tecnología y las
          herramientas más modernas a cargo de personal técnicamente calificado.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="#servicios"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-700 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all"
            >Explorar Servicios</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NOSOTROS -->
    <section id="nosotros" class="py-24 bg-white">
      <div
        class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start"
      >
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">Quiénes Somos</h2>

          <div class="mb-8">
            <h3
              class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg
              >
              Nuestra Misión
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-justify">
              Desarrollar obras y servicios de ingeniería, bajo criterios de
              calidad, eficiencia e innovación, orientados a contribuir al
              mejoramiento de la productividad y competitividad de las empresas,
              brindando soluciones y satisfacción plena a nuestros clientes a
              través de una gestión seria y responsable.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-10">
            <h3
              class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"
                ></path></svg
              >
              Nuestra Visión
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-justify">
              Apuntamos a ser una empresa líder en la región, alcanzando la
              excelencia en los productos y servicios que brindamos,
              comprometidos con políticas de largo plazo de innovación
              tecnológica, seguridad para nuestros clientes y empleados y de
              sustentabilidad del medio ambiente.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h4
            class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4"
          >
            Nuestros Valores Fundamentales
          </h4>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <span
              class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 rounded-full text-sm font-bold border border-blue-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-default"
              >Seguridad</span
            >
            <span
              class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 rounded-full text-sm font-bold border border-blue-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-default"
              >Compromiso</span
            >
            <span
              class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 rounded-full text-sm font-bold border border-blue-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-default"
              >Excelencia</span
            >
            <span
              class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 rounded-full text-sm font-bold border border-blue-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-default"
              >Integridad</span
            >
            <span
              class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 rounded-full text-sm font-bold border border-blue-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-default"
              >Innovación</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative lg:sticky lg:top-32">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504307651254-35680f356dfd?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
            alt="Trabajo en equipo de ingeniería"
            class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl object-cover h-[500px] w-full border-4 border-white"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SERVICIOS (Compactado con Badges para ahorrar espacio) -->
    <section id="servicios" class="py-24 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
            Nuestros Servicios
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600">
            Garantizamos seguridad, eficiencia y calidad en cada proyecto,
            cumpliendo con los más altos estándares técnicos y normativos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
          <!-- Servicio 1 -->
          <div
            class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all group flex flex-col"
          >
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
              Sistemas Eléctricos
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-5 flex-grow">
              Suministro, instalación y mantenimiento en alta, media y baja
              tensión.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Expedientes técnicos</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Tableros y subestaciones</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Pozo a tierra</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Servicio 2 -->
          <div
            class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all group flex flex-col"
          >
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-red-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M17.657 18.657A8 8 0 016.343 7.343S7 9 9 10c0-2 .5-5 2.986-7C14 5 16.09 5.777 17.656 7.343A7.975 7.975 0 0120 13a7.975 7.975 0 01-2.343 5.657z"
                ></path><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M9.879 16.121A3 3 0 1012.015 11L11 14H9c0 .768.293 1.536.879 2.121z"
                ></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
              Contraincendios
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-5 flex-grow">
              Soluciones integrales bajo normativas para proteger personas e
              instalaciones.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Alarmas direccionables</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Detección temprana</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Áreas críticas</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Servicio 3 -->
          <div
            class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all group flex flex-col"
          >
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"
                ></path><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
              Industria y Minería
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-5 flex-grow">
              Aseguramos el máximo rendimiento en plantas concentradoras y
              operaciones.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Fajas y molinos</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Soldadura industrial</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Metalmecánica</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Servicio 4 -->
          <div
            class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-100 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all group flex flex-col"
          >
            <div
              class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-red-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"
                ></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
              Infraestructura y Obras
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-5 flex-grow">
              Desarrollo de obras civiles duraderas para la industria y vías de
              comunicación.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto">
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Gaviones y taludes</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Vías carrozables</span
              >
              <span
                class="text-xs font-medium bg-slate-50 text-slate-600 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-slate-100"
                >Carpeta asfáltica</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTACTO / FOOTER -->
    <footer id="contacto" class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 py-16">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white text-xl font-bold mb-4">
            GRUPO <span class="text-red-500">HIRBELL</span> S.C.R.L.
          </h3>
          <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-400">
            Ingeniería y Servicios Generales. Promovemos el desarrollo empleando
            la tecnología y las herramientas más modernas.
          </p>
          <p
            class="font-mono text-sm bg-slate-800 inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded text-blue-400"
          >
            RUC: 20605788786
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4 text-lg">
            Nuestras Oficinas
          </h4>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"
                ></path><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg
              >
              Urb. Valle Blanco, Cerro Colorado - Arequipa
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"
                ></path><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg
              >
              Av. Independencia La "Y" - Juliaca, Puno
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-500 shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"
                ></path><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg
              >
              Parcialidad Yaurifina - San Antón, Azángaro
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 class="text-white font-semibold mb-4 text-lg">Contacto</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <!-- Números con enlace directo a WhatsApp e ícono de WhatsApp -->
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51a12.8 12.8 0 00-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"
                ></path></svg
              >
              <div class="flex gap-2">
                <a
                  href="https://wa.me/51913082572"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="hover:text-green-400 hover:underline transition-colors font-medium"
                  >913-082572</a
                >
                <span class="text-slate-600">/</span>
                <a
                  href="https://wa.me/51980562011"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="hover:text-green-400 hover:underline transition-colors font-medium"
                  >980-562011</a
                >
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-red-500"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"
                ></path></svg
              >
              <a
                href="mailto:gerencia@grupohirbell.com.pe"
                class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                >gerencia@grupohirbell.com.pe</a
              >
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2 pl-7">
              <a
                href="mailto:administracion@grupohirbell.com.pe"
                class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                >administracion@grupohirbell.com.pe</a
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
